### 3. Man-in-the-Middle Simulation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulations/mitm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "p": 37,
  "g": 2,
  "a": 5,
  "b": 8,
  "x": 9,
  "y": 12
}

